  "methodology": "Whole-year crop rules combine NOAA freeze climatology with Cooperative Extension crop biology. Freeze dates are probability anchors, not guarantees. Direct sowing, indoor starts, transplanting, soil-temperature gates, heat limits, fall slowdown, succession, photoperiod and cultivar maturity are treated separately.",
  "source_notes": "Generic maturity values are planning defaults only. A named cultivar's seed-packet maturity and local Extension guidance supersede them.",
